@name     macro_list_query
@alias    ?m
@group    sys
@c_name   skode_clause_macro_list_query
@type     immediate
@arity    0
@match    ()
@summary  list all defined user macros
@doc
Prints list of all defined user macros with RT capability status.
Usage: ?m
@code
    return skode_exec_qm(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
